      "toleranceRationale": "Casing, whitespace and duplicates are noise; the overlap threshold is an explicit integer percentage.",
      "useWhen": "Extracting entities, names or ids where order does not matter.",
      "whyNotStrictEq": "Order, casing and duplicates vary without changing the extracted set."
